\author{nimarasekh}
\author{markwilliams}
\title{Work relating to synthetic quasicoherence}
\import{stt-macros}
\meta{source}{\PR{205}}
\meta{source}{\PR{210}}
\meta{source}{\PR{212}}

\ul{
\li{
Thanks to [[markwilliams]] for getting [his PR](stt-00TD) on
the basics of quasicoherence out just in time for the workshop.
}
\li{
[[nimarasekh]] worked on showing that quasicoherence of #{\II[x]} implies that every
endomap of #{\Delta^1} is monotone (\ref{stt-00TV}), and that Phoa's principle
implies quasicoherence of #{\II[x]} (SQCP) (\ref{stt-00TC}).
\em{Monotonicity of endomaps} is a condition that has since been developed under the
name of [\em{directedness}](Synthetic.Directedness), a term suggested by
[[reidbarton]].
}
}

